WEBVTT

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:12.720
Hey, Kana-chan.

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:13.840
What?

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:15.690
Breakfast!

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:17.640
I already told you sorry.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.430
You woke up once, right?

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:21.140
Why did you go back to sleep?

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:26.570
Because you said "hurry"...

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:28.810
I couldn't help it.

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:30.440
Send...

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:33.820
This station is a smoke free facility outside of the designated areas.
But I'm hungry! I'm really hungry!

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:37.220
Okay, okay. I'll buy you something at the concession stand later.

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:37.420
We ask that you only smoke in the designated areas.

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:38.170
Yay!

00:01:38.170 --> 00:01:41.220
I want pudding, a ham omelet, melon bread, and pudding.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:43.900
You put pudding on the list twice.
We ask that you only smoke in the designated areas.

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:47.060
You need to wake up too.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:50.120
I didn't even have time to put in my contacts, let alone eat breakfast.

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:53.550
I'd be up in a heartbeat if you woke me up with a kiss.

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:55.130
Why you...

00:01:56.400 --> 00:02:03.100
Wait, why didn't you get up if you were awake?!

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:08.240
I love your hair down too!

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:08.710
Saku-chan!

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:09.760
A local train headed for Omiya is approaching on line three.

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:11.140
Good morning!

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:12.090
Good morning...

00:02:12.090 --> 00:02:15.220
Good morning, Kanade-senpai, Yukino-senpai...

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:15.930
Please stand behind the yellow line.

00:02:15.930 --> 00:02:17.320
G-Glasses?!

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:19.350
You're wearing glasses!
Please stand behind the yellow line.

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:19.780
For the first time!
Please stand behind the yellow line.

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:20.270
For the first time!

00:02:20.270 --> 00:02:20.980
So rare!

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:22.100
So good!

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:24.800
It was well worth waiting here at the risk of being late for school!

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:26.660
Really...

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:30.590
Besides, we see each other at school without you having to do this every morning.

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:33.900
Don't be so embarrassed.

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:35.250
Ask, and we'll come pick you up at the dorm.

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.490
Wait, we're not talking about that.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:37.980
Actually, let's do that!

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:38.640
Hello?

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:39.110
Are you listening to me?
Actually, let's do that!

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:40.920
We'll start tomorrow!

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.130
Kana-chan, the train's here!

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:42.820
Then how about we go for a drive from there?

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:44.540
The train is leaving.

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:45.080
Please do not...

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:47.990
I'll be okay if I skip school for a day.

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:50.860
Hey, strange girl! It's not safe to stand there, so step back!

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:54.390
And then, and then, we'll go to a spot with a great...

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:55.840
Eh? Huh?

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:57.780
Senpai?

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:01.380
I'm exhausted already.

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:04.570
She's coming out more and more.

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:11.760
Her house is on the other side of the school, so she rides past school every morning to get here.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:12.890
Seriously?!

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:14.850
That's dedication...

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:16.060
What about you?

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:16.880
Huh?

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:21.410
Would you come see me every day if you were her?

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:25.850
Well... you know what I'd do.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:28.580
Hey, Yuki-chan, do you feel like eating pudding?

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:30.480
You wouldn't come?

00:03:31.090 --> 00:03:32.900
I'd definitely come.

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:36.070
That was so mean, Senpai!

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:38.670
What was?

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:40.870
This morning!

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:43.130
Sorry.

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:44.750
I totally forgot.

00:03:45.510 --> 00:03:47.160
That's cold.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.680
I had to run so hard from the station.

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.970
And I was still late.

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:53.770
Really...

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:56.440
So go on a date with me this Sunday to make up for it!

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:58.990
Huh? That's quite a jump.

00:03:58.990 --> 00:04:00.030
But why...

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:01.940
If this Sunday doesn't work, we can do it today.

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:02.230
Please listen to what I say.

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:03.530
Actually, let's do it today!

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:03.950
I want to do it today!

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:04.730
And you! How dare you keep eating your pudding while ignoring this?!

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:06.600
I want to do it today!

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:07.800
And you! How dare you keep eating your pudding while ignoring this?!

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:09.290
Oh hey, Saku-chan!

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:10.310
Yes?

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:14.100
Wow! Thank you so much, Yukino-senpai!

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.310
I'll send these to you later.

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:17.160
Are there any others that you want?

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.990
What the heck are you doing?

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:22.840
I want this one, and this one too!

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:24.890
I'll send those later too.

00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:25.840
That's the fiftieth one then.

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:27.000
Fifty?!

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.270
So, as promised, here's the gift certificate for a parfait at the ritzy hotel by the station.

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.460
Yay!

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:35.300
Yuki-chan, come with me for a minute.

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:38.880
Yukino-senpai, don't forget to send them to me!

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:42.430
I got Kanade-senpai's left-overs!

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:33.180
We haven't done that since elementary school.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:38.930
What we used to do all the time, we gradually stopped doing.

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:42.650
We stopped carrying matching items sometime in middle school.

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:47.200
But our hearts always stayed close.

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:53.200
We should spend some time together once in a while like we used to.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:59.460
I want to be like that too...

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:02.110
It's looking good!

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:03.320
What is?

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:07.650
I see something good.

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:09.120
On the weather forecast?

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.100
Yeah.

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:11.260
I'll tell you another day.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:15.250
Anyway, is that thing we bought earlier really that good?

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:17.410
The super... whatever pillow?

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:21.300
It really feels great!

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:24.250
It's so good that we can drop an egg on it from the second floor without it breaking!

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:27.640
I'm sure that's a fake egg made for the commercial.

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:29.200
It's not!

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:30.600
It's really great!

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:31.530
Watch this.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.170
Wait...

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:33.950
There!

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:37.860
Huh?

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:39.390
As I expected.

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:45.270
Kana-chan, you dummy.

00:06:45.270 --> 00:06:48.350
I'm sorry, but you were wrong.

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:50.980
I just bought it!

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:53.680
And it felt great too!

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:57.640
Kana-chan, Kana-chan, buy me another one for Christmas!

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:58.680
Nope.

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:03.250
The clouds are really dark.

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:05.310
Yup, looking good.

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:07.360
What is?

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.150
It's nothing.

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:13.400
Anyway, I have an umbrella in the club room, so we'll be okay.

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:14.480
Okay.

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:17.950
Either way, you've been acting strange since yesterday.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.560
Have I?

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:22.690
I don't have anything bad in mind. Okay?

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:40.040
It started!

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:44.200
I'll send you an email when we're done.

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:46.290
Okay. I'll see you at the entrance.

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:51.510
Also, don't come to the pool if you don't need to, since it's embarrassing for me.

00:07:51.510 --> 00:07:52.740
I'll try.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:55.200
I'll see you later.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:55.880
Okay.

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:02.520
No umbrella...

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:04.390
Why?!

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:08.610
I've always left it here and never used it, so it should be here.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:11.490
Sunny all week?!

00:08:11.490 --> 00:08:13.990
Besides, we can't go home without an umbrella.

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:19.380
I've been thinking about this for the past three days, so I'm not thinking straight.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:23.890
I'm totally useless.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:30.700
I can try to borrow one from someone,

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:32.500
but...

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:39.020
We could run to the station and buy an umbrella there.

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:42.330
I should be happy with the walk from the station to the dorm.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.410
When will it rain next?

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:49.050
Kanade-senpai!

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:50.040
What are you doing here?

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:51.520
Saku-chan?

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:54.130
Club practice is over?

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:54.940
Yes!

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:58.110
Wait, you're not going home yet?

00:08:58.110 --> 00:08:59.490
Yeah...

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:05.570
Um, Saku-chan, do you have a spare umbrella?

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:06.690
I'm sorry.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:10.870
I don't have one either, so I had to call home to get a ride.

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:13.080
I see, that's too bad.

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:17.870
If you want, we can give you a ride, and we can go home together.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:19.420
Um...

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:24.060
Oh yeah, there's somewhere I need to go with Yuki-chan today.

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:27.520
I appreciate the offer, but sorry.

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:29.080
Really...

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.790
Say, Saku-chan...

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:32.770
Yes?

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:36.280
You're friends with Yuki-chan, right?

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:37.510
Yeah.

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:41.100
She's really kind, and gave me all of your...

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:43.650
Wait, put that aside.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:49.260
And you are... in love with me...

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:50.410
Yes!

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:55.560
So, I was wondering what your relationship with Yuki-chan is.

00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:58.980
I'm not sure what you mean.

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:05.380
Do you mean that I can date you if my relationship with her goes bad? Or if I hate Yukino-senpai?

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:12.460
Even if so, that doesn't feel totally right.

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:15.650
It's kind of embarrassing to talk about...

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:17.080
Thanks.

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:19.840
You're a better girl than I thought.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:22.470
What do you mean by that?

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:24.040
Anyway, see ya!

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.320
Brrr!

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:40.860
Thanks for waiting, Kana-chan.

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:42.070
Let's hurry home.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.840
Y-Yeah.

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:45.430
Um, Yuki-chan...

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:46.240
Hmm?

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:52.050
The umbrella I thought I had wasn't there,

00:10:52.050 --> 00:10:55.280
so I asked around to see if I could borrow one from one of my friends,

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:58.880
but it was late and not many of them were around, so...

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:00.090
I'm sorry!

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:02.320
I'll buy one at a convenience store, so let's run to the station.

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:06.440
Here's mine.

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:10.890
Why?

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:12.870
Why do you think?

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:17.570
Yuki-chan,

00:11:18.390 --> 00:11:21.000
did you know all along?

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:23.090
I had a hunch.

00:11:23.090 --> 00:11:25.800
You've been grinning recently while looking at the weather forecast.

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:27.500
Let's get going.

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:30.840
You should have told me if you had one!

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:32.220
I look like a dork.

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:36.040
Even if there are two of us and two umbrellas,

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:41.100
don't you get the urge to use one umbrella?

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:44.550
Well, I see your point...

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:47.140
Do you not like it?

00:11:47.140 --> 00:11:50.330
Well...

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.660
Isn't this what you wanted to do?

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:54.610
Yes. I'm sorry.

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:56.030
You're absolutely right.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.520
You could just ask normally.

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:00.840
Silly you.

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:03.430
Yeah.

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:06.610
I was thinking too much.

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:07.740
I know!

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:11.800
While we're talking about doing things we haven't done in a while, I'll wash your hair tonight.

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:13.590
Why all of a sudden?

00:12:14.550 --> 00:12:15.750
I just want to.

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:17.750
Silly Yuki-chan.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:20.880
By the way, you erased those photos from the other day, right?

00:12:20.880 --> 00:12:23.260
I just heard something from Saku-chan.

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:27.730
Hey!

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:28.970
Ta-da!

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:31.110
I've got Senpai's umbrella!

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:34.700
The plan of taking her out for a drive while taking her home when she doesn't have an umbrella failed,

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:36.380
but this is good too!

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:39.480
Huh?

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:46.880
Yuki-chan.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:49.710
Yuki-chan, it's morning.

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:50.630
Wake...

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:56.760
Yeah, yeah.

00:13:56.760 --> 00:14:00.360
Stop being silly and get up, Yuki-chan!
